16. Important: Relative Performance Is Not Calculated Against Target

Target and relative performance answer different questions.
Target asks: "Did you meet the required standard?"
Relative ranking asks: "How do you compare with your peers?"
Therefore:


Relative Percentile is calculated from peer performance.
Target Gate is calculated from the approved KPI target.
The two are then used together.
This prevents double-counting the target.
