18. Step 7 — Calculate Final KPI Score

Standard Formula: Final KPI Score = (Absolute Score × 70%) + (Relative Score × 30%)


Example:


Absolute Score = 95
Relative Score = 80
Calculation:


95 × 70% = 66.5
80 × 30% = 24
Final KPI Score: 66.5 + 24 = 90.5
Therefore: "Final KPI Score = 90.5"
