22. PACE Guardrails

A mathematical score must not hide a serious KPI problem.
Peak:


To receive P — Peak:
Overall Score ≥90
No KPI below A
No critical Quality failure
All applicable target gates satisfied
Achieving:


To receive A — Achieving:
Overall Score ≥80
No KPI classified as E
Required target gates satisfied
Concerning:


C applies when:
Overall Score is 70–79.99, or
A material KPI gap exists
Escalate:


E applies when:
Overall Score <70, or
Multiple material KPI gaps exist, or
A critical Quality failure occurs
