40. Governing Principle

PACE should always follow this sequence: "STANDARD → PERFORMANCE → RELATIVE POSITION → PACE"
Not: "RANK → QUARTILE → LABEL"
The objective is to create a performance system where meeting the account standard matters first, while relative ranking provides an additional layer of differentiation among comparable performers.
First, meet the standard. Then, demonstrate excellence.

